      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "オレっちの集落は、塩の生産で稼いでるんす。\n今度、塩の取引先の偉い人を呼んで\n契約の話をするんで、その取引がうまくいくよう、\n綺麗な踊りを頼みたいっす。よろしく御願いしやす！",
        "official_en": "My hamlet specializes in producing salt, and I have\nan important client coming to discuss a contract.\nI need someone to perform a beautiful dance to make\nsure the deal goes through. Please and thank you!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
